{
  "slug": "tookan",
  "name": "Tookan",
  "description": "Tookan (Jungleworks) delivery and field workforce management: create, edit, assign and track pickup, delivery, appointment and field tasks, update their status, see agents with their location and status, teams and customers. One API key.",
  "instructions": "## Tookan\nThis connector works with **Tookan** by Jungleworks, the delivery and field workforce management platform, through its API v2 at `https://api.tookanapp.com/v2`: tasks (pickups, deliveries, appointments, field work), agents, teams and customers.\n\n**Setup (about 2 minutes)**\n1. Sign in at https://app.tookanapp.com and open **Settings, API Keys**.\n2. On the **V2** tab copy the API key (click **Generate Key** if the list is empty) into `TOOKAN_API_KEY`.\n\nEvery Tookan call is a POST with a JSON body; the connector adds `api_key` to each body. The key gives full access to the account, so treat it like a password.\n\n**Where to start**: `tookan_list_teams` for team ids, `tookan_list_agents` for agents and their status, `tookan_list_tasks` for the tasks of a day (it needs job_type, start_date and end_date), `tookan_get_task_details` for one task.\n\n**Tasks**: `tookan_list_tasks` (one task type at a time, at most 31 days, paged with requested_page), `tookan_get_task_details` (up to 100 ids, with history), `tookan_get_tasks_by_order_id` (your own order ids), `tookan_get_related_tasks` (the pickup and delivery of one order). Write: `tookan_create_task`, `tookan_edit_task`, `tookan_update_task_status`, `tookan_assign_task`. `tookan_delete_task` is installed switched off; cancel with status 9 instead.\n\n**Task kinds** for `tookan_create_task` (layout_type, has_pickup, has_delivery): pickup 0,1,0; delivery 0,0,1; pickup and delivery 0,1,1; appointment 1,0,0; field workforce 2,0,0. Statuses: 0 assigned, 1 started, 2 successful, 3 failed, 4 in progress or arrived, 6 unassigned, 7 accepted, 8 declined, 9 cancelled, 10 deleted. Task types in lists: 0 pickup, 1 delivery, 2 appointment, 3 field workforce.\n\n**Times**: task times are local `YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM:SS`; list filters take `YYYY-MM-DD`. `timezone` is the UTC offset in minutes with the sign inverted: India -330, Central Europe -60 (winter) or -120 (summer), New York 300 (winter). Answers mix formats and use `0000-00-00 00:00:00` for empty times.\n\n**Agents and teams**: `tookan_list_agents`, `tookan_get_agent_profile`, `tookan_get_agent_location`, `tookan_find_agents_nearby`, `tookan_list_teams`. Agent status: 0 available, 1 offline, 2 busy.\n\n**Customers**: `tookan_list_customers`, `tookan_find_customer_by_phone`, `tookan_get_customer`, `tookan_add_customer`, `tookan_edit_customer`; `tookan_delete_customer` is installed switched off. Login tokens and password hashes that Tookan includes in agent and customer answers are removed before they reach the AI.\n\n**Errors**: Tookan reports the result in the body: `status` 200 is success, 100 a missing parameter, 101 an invalid API key, 201 a refused action with the reason in `message`, 404 an execution error. The connector turns these into failed calls with the message.\n\n**Not included**: agent wallet transactions, payouts and fare estimates (no money movement), merchant administration, geofences and webhooks. Tookan publishes no rate limits; avoid tight loops and prefer the date and id filters.",
  "aliases": [
    "Jungleworks Tookan",
    "Tookan API"
  ],
  "region": "intl",
  "category": "logistics",
  "icon": "tookan",
  "docsUrl": "https://tookanapi.docs.apiary.io/",
  "requiredEnvVars": [
    "TOOKAN_API_KEY"
  ],
  "envVarMeta": {
    "TOOKAN_API_KEY": {
      "label": "API key (V2)",
      "kind": "credential",
      "secret": true,
      "help": "Tookan, Settings, API Keys, V2 tab: copy the key, or click Generate Key if there is none.",
      "link": "https://app.tookanapp.com/#/app/settings/apikey",
      "pattern": "^[A-Za-z0-9]{20,200}$",
      "patternMessage": "Paste the V2 API key only, letters and digits without spaces."
    }
  },
  "verifyHints": {
    "401": "Tookan refused the API key. Copy the key from Settings, API Keys, V2 tab again (a V1 key does not work), or generate a new one.",
    "400": "Tookan refused the request; its message names the missing or wrong field.",
    "rate_limited": "Tookan is throttling requests. Wait a moment and try again."
  },
  "probe": {
    "tool": "tookan_list_teams",
    "params": {}
  },
  "prerequisites": "A Tookan account (app.tookanapp.com) with access to Settings, API Keys to copy the V2 key. About 2 minutes.",
  "connector": {
    "name": "Tookan API v2",
    "type": "REST",
    "baseUrl": "https://api.tookanapp.com/v2",
    "authType": "NONE",
    "authConfig": {},
    "headers": {
      "Accept": "application/json",
      "Content-Type": "application/json"
    },
    "config": {
      "errorWhen": [
        {
          "path": "status",
          "equals": 101,
          "messagePath": "message",
          "status": 401
        },
        {
          "path": "status",
          "in": [
            100,
            201
          ],
          "messagePath": "message",
          "status": 400
        },
        {
          "path": "status",
          "equals": 404,
          "messagePath": "message",
          "status": 400
        }
      ]
    }
  },
  "tools": [
    {
      "name": "tookan_list_tasks",
      "description": "List tasks of one type in a date range (at most 31 days): job_id, order_id, job_status (0 assigned, 1 started, 2 successful, 3 failed, 4 in progress or arrived, 6 unassigned, 7 accepted, 8 declined, 9 cancelled, 10 deleted), job_type, agent (fleet_id, fleet_name), team, customer, addresses, scheduled and completed times, tracking link. Paginated with requested_page. Read-only.",
      "parameters": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "job_type": {
            "type": "integer",
            "enum": [
              0,
              1,
              2,
              3
            ],
            "description": "Task type: 0 pickup, 1 delivery, 2 appointment, 3 field workforce."
          },
          "start_date": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "date",
            "description": "First task date, YYYY-MM-DD."
          },
          "end_date": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "date",
            "description": "Last task date, YYYY-MM-DD, at most 31 days after start_date."
          },
          "job_status": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Only tasks in this status, as a string: 0 assigned, 1 started, 2 successful, 3 failed, 4 in progress or arrived, 6 unassigned, 7 accepted, 8 declined, 9 cancelled, 10 deleted."
          },
          "team_id": {
            "type": "integer",
            "description": "Only tasks of this team."
          },
          "fleet_id": {
            "type": "integer",
            "description": "Only tasks of this agent."
          },
          "customer_id": {
            "type": "integer",
            "description": "Only tasks of this customer."
          },
          "order_id": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "description": "Only tasks with these order ids."
          },
          "job_id": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "integer"
            },
            "description": "Only these task ids."
          },
          "custom_fields": {
            "type": "integer",
            "enum": [
              0,
              1
            ],
            "description": "1 includes custom field values."
          },
          "is_pagination": {
            "type": "integer",
            "enum": [
              0,
              1
            ],
            "default": 1,
            "description": "1 (default) pages the result."
          },
          "requested_page": {
            "type": "integer",
            "minimum": 1,
            "default": 1,
            "description": "Page number, starting at 1."
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "job_type",
          "start_date",
          "end_date"
        ]
      },
      "endpointMapping": {
        "method": "POST",
        "path": "/get_all_tasks",
        "bodyMapping": {
          "api_key": "{{TOOKAN_API_KEY}}",
          "job_type": "$job_type",
          "start_date": "$start_date",
          "end_date": "$end_date",
          "job_status": "$job_status",
          "team_id": "$team_id",
          "fleet_id": "$fleet_id",
          "customer_id": "$customer_id",
          "order_id": "$order_id",
          "job_id": "$job_id",
          "custom_fields": "$custom_fields",
          "is_pagination": "$is_pagination",
          "requested_page": "$requested_page"
        }
      },
      "annotations": {
        "readOnlyHint": true
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "tookan_get_task_details",
      "description": "Read up to 100 tasks by id: status, type, agent, team, customer, addresses and coordinates, scheduled, started, arrived and completed times (UTC and local), pickup and delivery relationship, distance travelled, tracking link, and optionally the task history and custom fields. Read-only.",
      "parameters": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "job_ids": {
            "type": "array",
            "minItems": 1,
            "maxItems": 100,
            "items": {
              "type": "integer"
            },
            "description": "Task ids, at most 100."
          },
          "include_task_history": {
            "type": "integer",
            "enum": [
              0,
              1
            ],
            "default": 0,
            "description": "1 adds the status history (assigned, started, notes, images)."
          },
          "job_additional_info": {
            "type": "integer",
            "enum": [
              0,
              1
            ],
            "description": "1 adds custom fields and extra details."
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "job_ids"
        ]
      },
      "endpointMapping": {
        "method": "POST",
        "path": "/get_job_details",
        "bodyMapping": {
          "api_key": "{{TOOKAN_API_KEY}}",
          "job_ids": "$job_ids",
          "include_task_history": "$include_task_history",
          "job_additional_info": "$job_additional_info"
        }
      },
      "annotations": {
        "readOnlyHint": true
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "tookan_get_tasks_by_order_id",
      "description": "Read the tasks created with your own order ids (order_id field of create): the same details as tookan_get_task_details. Read-only.",
      "parameters": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "order_ids": {
            "type": "array",
            "minItems": 1,
            "maxItems": 100,
            "items": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "description": "Your order ids."
          },
          "include_task_history": {
            "type": "integer",
            "enum": [
              0,
              1
            ],
            "default": 0,
            "description": "1 adds the status history."
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "order_ids"
        ]
      },
      "endpointMapping": {
        "method": "POST",
        "path": "/get_job_details_by_order_id",
        "bodyMapping": {
          "api_key": "{{TOOKAN_API_KEY}}",
          "order_ids": "$order_ids",
          "include_task_history": "$include_task_history"
        }
      },
      "annotations": {
        "readOnlyHint": true
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "tookan_get_related_tasks",
      "description": "Read the pickup and delivery tasks that belong together, by the pickup_delivery_relationship value of a task. Read-only.",
      "parameters": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "pickup_delivery_relationship": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "The pickup_delivery_relationship value from a task's details."
          }
        },
